      "title": "Exported is not automatically exploitable",
      "caption": "If an Android component is exported, does that make the application vulnerable? Not automatically.\n\nReachability matters, but so do permissions, actual behavior, and whether sensitive functionality can be accessed without authorization.\n\nA configuration flag is an observation. A security finding needs reproducible impact in an authorized test.\n\nRead the field note: https://ahmadib.onrender.com/articles/exported-android-components.html\n\n#AndroidSecurity #MobileAppSec #SecureCoding",
